msgid "Sized for %(context)s tokens, with every figure from a placement computed for this machine. `llamafit plan MODEL --quant NAME` opens one of these rows into the budget line by line, the context ladder and the command line that runs it."
msgstr "Dimenzionirano za %(context)s tokena, sa svakom brojkom iz smještaja izračunatog za ovo računalo. `llamafit plan MODEL --quant NAME` otvara jedan od ovih redaka u proračun redak po redak, ljestvicu konteksta i naredbeni redak koji ga pokreće."

msgid "To reach %(context)s tokens, free %(free)s more on the graphics card: that rung needs %(needed)s, which is %(share)s of what is free and over the line where the driver starts paging."
msgstr "Da biste dosegli %(context)s tokena, oslobodite još %(free)s na grafičkoj kartici: toj prečki treba %(needed)s, što je %(share)s slobodnoga i iznad crte na kojoj upravljački program počinje straničiti."

msgid "%(context)s tokens is past what this machine holds: that rung needs %(needed)s on the graphics card and there is nothing left to absorb what would not fit, so freeing the card is not the change that reaches it."
msgstr "%(context)s tokena je iznad onoga što ovo računalo drži: toj prečki treba %(needed)s na grafičkoj kartici, a nije ostalo ništa što bi upilo ono što ne stane, pa oslobađanje kartice nije promjena koja do nje dovodi."

msgid "%(quant)s, the next quantisation down, could not be sized: %(reason)s"
msgstr "%(quant)s, kvantizacija ispod, nije se mogla dimenzionirati: %(reason)s"

msgid "%(quant)s, the next quantisation down, does not fit this machine either."
msgstr "%(quant)s, kvantizacija ispod, također ne stane na ovo računalo."

msgid "%(quant)s, the next quantisation down, was planned here too: %(mode)s, %(verdict)s, up to %(context)s tokens."
msgstr "%(quant)s, kvantizacija ispod, planirana je i ovdje: %(mode)s, %(verdict)s, do %(context)s tokena."

msgid "%(quant)s, the next quantisation down, was planned here too: %(mode)s, %(verdict)s, up to %(context)s tokens at %(tps)s tokens per second."
msgstr "%(quant)s, kvantizacija ispod, planirana je i ovdje: %(mode)s, %(verdict)s, do %(context)s tokena pri %(tps)s tokena u sekundi."

msgid "It fits entirely on the graphics card, which this one does not."
msgstr "Ona stane u cijelosti na grafičku karticu, što ova ne."

msgid "It fits better: %(theirs)s rather than %(mine)s."
msgstr "Bolje stane: %(theirs)s umjesto %(mine)s."

msgid "It holds %(theirs)s tokens rather than %(mine)s."
msgstr "Drži %(theirs)s tokena umjesto %(mine)s."

msgid "It generates %(theirs)s tokens per second rather than %(mine)s."
msgstr "Generira %(theirs)s tokena u sekundi umjesto %(mine)s."

msgid "It is no better here, so there is nothing to gain by dropping to it."
msgstr "Ovdje nije ništa bolja, pa se prelaskom na nju nema što dobiti."

msgid "Every context this model offers already fits here; the machine is not what limits it."
msgstr "Svaki kontekst koji ovaj model nudi ovdje već stane; računalo nije ono što ga ograničava."

msgid "What would change it"
msgstr "Što bi to promijenilo"

